# SINTRAN boot from the Winchester (task 4). EXPECTED TO FAIL until the
# early ERRFATAL (L-reg 042514) is fixed - FAILON catches it precisely,
# and a HANG verdict means it died silently instead.
FAILON ERRFATAL
FAILON System malfunction
LABEL boot SINTRAN from Winchester
SEND 201540&
LABEL waiting for the SINTRAN banner (long)
EXPECT 600 SINTRAN|RUNNING|ENTER
QUIET 5
